    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606150/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1745005210\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Escape the reoccurring nightmare and stop the cycle by fighting through strange enemies and collecting items and information to get out before you wake up, otherwise the dream resets, but changes slightly. <i>Somniphobia</i> combines traditional survival horror elements such as combat, fixed camera angles, and item collection, with rogue-like elements where the item, enemy, and room placement will be different every night.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606150/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1745005210\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tank control movement<br></li><li>Fixed cameras<br></li><li>Procedural item and enemy placement<br></li><li>Resource management<br></li><li>Randomized map layout</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606150/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1745005210\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606150/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1745005210\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Escape the reoccurring nightmare and stop the cycle by fighting through strange enemies and collecting items and information to get out before you wake up, otherwise the dream resets, but changes slightly. <i>Somniphobia</i> combines traditional survival horror elements such as combat, fixed camera angles, and item collection, with rogue-like elements where the item, enemy, and room placement will be different every night.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606150/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1745005210\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tank control movement<br></li><li>Fixed cameras<br></li><li>Procedural item and enemy placement<br></li><li>Resource management<br></li><li>Randomized map layout</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606150/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1745005210\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
